WEBVTT

00:25.660 --> 00:28.414
<b>Subs Edited by DizzyAngelDemon...</b>

00:31.660 --> 00:34.314
<b>made to fit the Uncut,
Directors Cut Edition of KITE in HD</b>

00:35.260 --> 00:38.614
<b>Available at hshare.net</b>

00:46.380 --> 00:47.914
<b>How do you like this building?</b>

00:48.550 --> 00:50.865
<b>Is this a cool place or what?</b>

00:51.036 --> 00:51.854
<b>Yeah...</b>

01:07.518 --> 01:09.407
<b>You're special, you know.</b>

01:10.432 --> 01:16.198
<b>Those ugly dogs in my fan
club don't know about this place.</b>

01:20.779 --> 01:27.766
<b>You're disgusting, you vulgar,
arrogant, retarded celebrity punk...</b>

01:28.275 --> 01:31.520
<b>Just because you have some TV show.</b>

01:31.657 --> 01:33.011
<b>Give me a break.</b>

01:33.278 --> 01:36.131
<b>Who do you think you are?</b>

01:36.233 --> 01:36.819
<b>Shame--</b>

01:36.896 --> 01:37.359
<b>You bitch!</b>

01:40.607 --> 01:43.186
<b>How do you like being kicked
by a retarded celebrity punk?</b>

01:43.526 --> 01:45.312
<b>You old bitch!</b>

01:46.545 --> 01:50.288
<b>Your stinking perfume makes me sick!</b>

01:50.985 --> 01:53.442
<b>You're the disgusting one, bitch!</b>

02:17.445 --> 02:20.915
<b>I'm going to sue you for this...</b>

02:22.154 --> 02:26.428
<b>M-My son is an excellent lawyer.</b>

02:27.293 --> 02:30.867
<b>A punk like you will
be squashed like a bug.</b>

02:31.670 --> 02:33.490
<b>Do you hear me, punk?</b>

03:37.064 --> 03:41.124
<b>We found traces of two bullets...
in the chest and in the head.</b>

03:41.804 --> 03:43.662
<b>I see signs of blood under the skin.</b>

03:47.272 --> 03:48.569
<b>He must have died instantly.</b>

03:48.972 --> 03:49.668
<b>Mr. Akai...</b>

03:51.309 --> 03:53.834
<b>It must have been a very special gun...</b>

03:54.747 --> 03:56.871
<b>The bullets exploded inside his body.</b>

04:01.556 --> 04:03.382
<b>Better check those bullet fragments.</b>

04:04.721 --> 04:06.245
<b>Is the medical team here yet?</b>

04:06.557 --> 04:09.022
<b>They're all in the hospital
because of food poisoning.</b>

04:09.090 --> 04:10.992
<b>Those assholes.</b>

04:11.693 --> 04:13.457
<b>What a waste of our tax money.</b>

04:14.263 --> 04:15.091
<b>What's with granny?</b>

04:16.564 --> 04:17.931
<b>Probably shocked to death.</b>

04:19.068 --> 04:21.436
<b>Looks like it was a heart attack.</b>

04:22.703 --> 04:25.036
<b>Get an autopsy just in case.</b>

04:26.307 --> 04:28.740
<b>So, this guy's a celebrity?</b>

04:29.274 --> 04:33.003
<b>He has seven TV shows a week.</b>

04:33.078 --> 04:35.273
<b>He's a popular comedian.</b>

04:36.115 --> 04:37.142
<b>What a joke.</b>

04:37.517 --> 04:39.948
<b>His usual material is about corpses.</b>

04:40.654 --> 04:42.645
<b>Nobody's gonna laugh at this.</b>

04:45.389 --> 04:47.017
<b>What a tearjerker.</b>

04:51.458 --> 04:53.553
<b>H-He was such a nice guy.</b>

04:55.033 --> 04:57.832
<b>W-Why would anyone kill him?</b>

04:59.870 --> 05:03.933
<b>He was the nicest guy I ever knew.</b>

05:06.980 --> 05:10.971
<b>I can't stand breaking
up our team like this...</b>

05:11.782 --> 05:13.840
<b>Mr. Ogata at the studio?</b>

05:14.581 --> 05:20.147
<b>His outraged fans are
rushing to the location.</b>

05:21.487 --> 05:23.581
<b>We can see how popular he was...</b>

05:25.192 --> 05:33.494
<b>Also, according to our sources,
this case may involve organized crime...</b>

05:33.568 --> 05:34.760
<b>Well done.</b>

05:36.737 --> 05:39.534
<b>I feel sorry for that old lady.</b>

05:40.772 --> 05:42.933
<b>People die everyday.</b>

05:45.845 --> 05:46.780
<b>Come here.</b>

05:49.281 --> 05:50.545
<b>I'm not in the mood today.</b>

05:57.454 --> 05:59.289
<b>Give it to me.</b>

06:00.791 --> 06:01.917
<b>I know...</b>

06:02.859 --> 06:03.485
<b>But...</b>

06:05.830 --> 06:06.593
<b>Sawa...</b>

06:07.896 --> 06:11.125
<b>I have enough problems already.</b>

06:12.133 --> 06:13.328
<b>Anything wrong?</b>

06:16.006 --> 06:16.934
<b>Can't you feel it?</b>

06:19.542 --> 06:20.508
<b>Get on top.</b>

06:59.042 --> 07:01.510
<b>Be more punctual, Oburi.</b>

07:02.950 --> 07:03.880
<b>Who are we doing?</b>

07:06.284 --> 07:06.873
<b>Which one?</b>

07:09.689 --> 07:10.813
<b>All of them.</b>

07:12.789 --> 07:14.381
<b>We've called someone else in.</b>

07:15.258 --> 07:17.347
<b>You take care of the one in front.</b>

07:17.560 --> 07:19.493
<b>The other one will take care of the rest.</b>

07:19.829 --> 07:21.524
<b>What did they do?</b>

07:22.428 --> 07:25.024
<b>The three of them are child molesters.</b>

07:26.169 --> 07:29.261
<b>They're going to pay for what they did.</b>

07:48.254 --> 07:50.619
<b>There's another one besides me...</b>

08:12.878 --> 08:15.640
<b>How about this weekend again?</b>

08:16.111 --> 08:18.272
<b>Call me when you can.</b>

08:18.850 --> 08:20.507
<b>You know our usual activity...</b>

08:21.083 --> 08:22.810
<b>My wife just isn't
good enough, you know?</b>

09:08.260 --> 09:08.954
<b>Surprised?</b>

09:09.424 --> 09:10.322
<b>You did it?</b>

09:11.396 --> 09:11.987
<b>Right.</b>

09:58.372 --> 10:00.802
<b>The reward for each
adult is the same as always.</b>

10:01.239 --> 10:02.867
<b>Take it from Kanie later.</b>

10:06.081 --> 10:07.772
<b>You stink, Mr. Akai.</b>

10:11.682 --> 10:16.519
<b>Oburi, I don't have
an easy job, you know.</b>

10:18.324 --> 10:21.488
<b>The stink from the corpses
makes my eyes water all the time.</b>

10:22.189 --> 10:24.183
<b>And that rotten smell is so strong...</b>

10:25.827 --> 10:28.386
<b>It's no wonder I always stink.</b>

10:50.147 --> 10:51.014
<b>Mr. Akai...</b>

10:51.720 --> 10:54.118
<b>Did you think about what I asked you?</b>

10:58.957 --> 10:59.547
<b>Sure.</b>

11:00.092 --> 11:01.717
<b>I don't want to hold you back.</b>

11:02.662 --> 11:03.354
<b>Wow...</b>

11:03.962 --> 11:06.590
<b>Your generosity makes me feel weird.</b>

11:09.667 --> 11:10.534
<b>However...</b>

11:10.935 --> 11:13.028
<b>...you have to take
care of three more jobs.</b>

11:13.505 --> 11:15.232
<b>I knew you'd say that.</b>

11:15.772 --> 11:18.204
<b>It's between you and me, isn't it?</b>

11:18.742 --> 11:21.299
<b>We've got to be fair to each other.</b>

11:22.145 --> 11:23.007
<b>Right, Kanie?</b>

11:23.147 --> 11:23.839
<b>Isn't that right?</b>

11:26.816 --> 11:29.906
<b>Mr. Kanie, I'll do my best to be on time.</b>

11:59.843 --> 12:00.969
<b>What are you doing?</b>

12:01.345 --> 12:02.279
<b>You suck!</b>

12:03.184 --> 12:04.080
<b>You're so slow!</b>

12:06.988 --> 12:08.043
<b>You retard!</b>

12:15.292 --> 12:17.417
<b>Give it to me!</b>

12:29.103 --> 12:31.801
<b>Hey, buddy, give us the ball!</b>

12:35.781 --> 12:37.208
<b>You got my jacket dirty.</b>

12:37.778 --> 12:39.474
<b>It wasn't that nice, anyway.</b>

12:39.715 --> 12:41.773
<b>Go home and wash it yourself, okay?</b>

13:33.263 --> 13:34.854
<b>He's pretty good.</b>

13:35.464 --> 13:37.659
<b>That's why I need you.</b>

13:49.841 --> 13:51.574
<b>1 05 yen is your change.</b>

13:51.647 --> 13:52.979
<b>Thank you very much.</b>

13:56.647 --> 13:57.135
<b>Hey!</b>

14:10.097 --> 14:12.029
<b>You look good in that uniform.</b>

14:12.498 --> 14:13.190
<b>You...</b>

14:25.476 --> 14:26.268
<b>Tastes good.</b>

14:26.877 --> 14:28.036
<b>This must be a new flavor.</b>

14:29.679 --> 14:30.338
<b>Want some?</b>

14:31.079 --> 14:33.569
<b>You asked Kanie
where I worked part-time?</b>

14:36.816 --> 14:37.408
<b>So...</b>

14:38.790 --> 14:39.313
<b>What?</b>

14:40.623 --> 14:42.817
<b>Tell me your name.</b>

14:43.790 --> 14:44.282
<b>Sawa.</b>

14:46.596 --> 14:49.827
<b>As in ''the sand you can't hold''
and ''the feather blown by the wind.''</b>

14:50.666 --> 14:51.688
<b>Remember that.</b>

14:52.366 --> 14:53.560
<b>Is that your real name?</b>

14:54.235 --> 14:54.928
<b>Of course.</b>

14:55.469 --> 14:56.196
<b>I'm...</b>

14:56.403 --> 14:56.894
<b>Oburi.</b>

14:57.302 --> 14:58.293
<b>You're Oburi, right?</b>

14:59.871 --> 15:02.002
<b>How much do you know about me?</b>

15:03.107 --> 15:03.839
<b>Are you mad?</b>

15:04.543 --> 15:05.738
<b>No, I'm just...</b>

15:07.109 --> 15:09.637
<b>Kanie told me your name, that's all.</b>

15:10.682 --> 15:12.049
<b>Is Oburi your real name?</b>

15:12.949 --> 15:13.716
<b>Yeah, it is.</b>

15:14.853 --> 15:16.180
<b>It's a very unusual name.</b>

15:16.854 --> 15:17.823
<b>Everyone says that.</b>

15:21.527 --> 15:22.617
<b>Do you have a family?</b>

15:23.260 --> 15:23.956
<b>Nope.</b>

15:24.595 --> 15:25.224
<b>You?</b>

15:27.129 --> 15:27.957
<b>Me neither.</b>

15:29.732 --> 15:31.293
<b>We're alike, aren't we?</b>

15:36.805 --> 15:38.502
<b>Can I ask you something?</b>

15:41.076 --> 15:41.602
<b>Sure.</b>

15:42.078 --> 15:42.703
<b>Anything.</b>

15:43.312 --> 15:44.301
<b>I'll tell you.</b>

16:09.869 --> 16:11.863
<b>What is Akai to you?</b>

16:13.505 --> 16:14.597
<b>He's...</b>

16:15.839 --> 16:17.970
<b>...my guardian.</b>

16:20.279 --> 16:21.540
<b>Same as me, huh?</b>

16:22.146 --> 16:23.640
<b>What a strange coincidence...</b>

16:24.984 --> 16:25.881
<b>...we have here.</b>

17:50.027 --> 17:52.153
<b>Those earrings
must be very special to you.</b>

17:53.596 --> 17:54.823
<b>Why's that?</b>

17:55.564 --> 17:59.331
<b>You were wearing
them the last time, too.</b>

18:03.807 --> 18:07.172
<b>They look weird, yet really beautiful.</b>

18:08.844 --> 18:09.466
<b>They're...</b>

18:10.713 --> 18:12.573
<b>...made from the
blood of my papa and mama.</b>

18:18.083 --> 18:23.111
<b>It's kind of my lucky charm.</b>

18:28.192 --> 18:28.715
<b>Let's go!</b>

18:30.393 --> 18:31.017
<b>Where is it?</b>

18:31.998 --> 18:33.984
<b>Your place.</b>

19:08.563 --> 19:09.925
<b>Shit...</b>

19:31.651 --> 19:32.482
<b>That's...</b>

19:33.052 --> 19:34.243
<b>You know him?</b>

19:35.217 --> 19:36.915
<b>He's a Hollywood movie star, isn't he?</b>

19:37.954 --> 19:39.649
<b>Some of my classmates are fans.</b>

19:41.457 --> 19:43.288
<b>But I didn't know that
he had a twin brother.</b>

19:43.658 --> 19:45.925
<b>They'll be here in a few minutes.</b>

19:48.531 --> 19:50.587
<b>This is the third celebrity.</b>

19:51.736 --> 19:52.598
<b>Kill...</b>

19:53.232 --> 19:54.201
<b>...the right one.</b>

19:55.103 --> 19:56.967
<b>If I get the wrong one, I'm sorry.</b>

19:59.239 --> 20:03.199
<b>He has three bodyguards, so be careful.</b>

20:08.048 --> 20:08.879
<b>Where do I get him?</b>

26:08.203 --> 26:08.794
<b>Give it back!</b>

26:09.837 --> 26:10.327
<b>Give it back!</b>

26:12.039 --> 26:12.663
<b>Give it back!</b>

26:12.873 --> 26:13.532
<b>Give it back to me!</b>

26:23.114 --> 26:27.072
<b>Don't you want to be
with your papa and mama?</b>

26:29.519 --> 26:30.281
<b>Kill him.</b>

26:34.858 --> 26:39.691
<b>This guy's one of the most
wanted, murdering, perverted bastards.</b>

26:40.361 --> 26:45.320
<b>He's been kidnapping
young girls, raping them...</b>

26:45.799 --> 26:49.063
<b>...and killing them by
chopping their bodies into pieces.</b>

26:49.769 --> 26:52.236
<b>Who cares if one or
two guys like him die?</b>

27:22.895 --> 27:25.988
<b>Find whoever killed my papa and mama.</b>

27:26.931 --> 27:30.127
<b>Yeah, I swear I will.</b>

27:51.583 --> 27:53.174
<b>Just die already!</b>

28:16.069 --> 28:17.661
<b>Manager, someone may catch us!</b>

28:18.005 --> 28:19.232
<b>Yes, but it's so exciting!</b>

29:47.108 --> 29:51.133
<b>If we're lucky, we'll find
something left behind by the suspect.</b>

29:51.578 --> 29:53.603
<b>Search every square inch of the room!</b>

29:55.482 --> 29:59.315
<b>You think we can find
anything in this mess?</b>

30:00.752 --> 30:03.379
<b>That's what a professional does, right?</b>

30:19.900 --> 30:23.858
<b>If you fell from this height, it'd
be impossible to identify the body .</b>

30:25.004 --> 30:27.028
<b>Lucky girl.</b>

30:27.407 --> 30:29.271
<b>Must've grown wings or something.</b>

30:31.208 --> 30:33.734
<b>Mr. Akai, can we come in now?</b>

30:34.378 --> 30:35.845
<b>Yeah, go ahead.</b>

30:38.214 --> 30:40.579
<b>There aren't that many
press people here today.</b>

30:41.217 --> 30:43.809
<b>They're all at the police station.</b>

30:44.587 --> 30:47.385
<b>Did they find out about the
chief's Lolita complex or something?</b>

30:48.156 --> 30:50.089
<b>Huh? You didn't know?</b>

30:50.657 --> 30:53.090
<b>There's a witness!</b>

30:53.293 --> 30:53.951
<b>What?</b>

30:59.999 --> 31:01.362
<b>Did he say anything?</b>

31:01.633 --> 31:02.291
<b>No.</b>

31:03.602 --> 31:06.502
<b>He's still in shock, but...</b>

31:07.171 --> 31:08.330
<b>...it's a woman.</b>

31:08.873 --> 31:09.600
<b>A woman?</b>

31:11.007 --> 31:12.872
<b>The killer was a woman.</b>

31:13.443 --> 31:14.431
<b>A young one.</b>

32:02.314 --> 32:03.042
<b>Mr. Akai...</b>

32:05.383 --> 32:06.476
<b>...how long
have you been there?</b>

32:07.184 --> 32:10.482
<b>Kanie, your woman
may have to wait a while.</b>

32:13.723 --> 32:15.486
<b>I'm going to go look for it.</b>

32:20.461 --> 32:22.554
<b>You were spotted at the scene, too.</b>

32:22.897 --> 32:25.763
<b>Why didn't you find it for me?</b>

32:26.300 --> 32:28.994
<b>The place was completely destroyed.</b>

32:31.337 --> 32:34.100
<b>That tiny earring must
have been destroyed too.</b>

32:34.507 --> 32:37.805
<b>That earring was important to me.</b>

32:38.208 --> 32:40.768
<b>You should know that best of all.</b>

32:42.312 --> 32:44.280
<b>One should be enough.</b>

32:46.683 --> 32:51.516
<b>Anyway, you should
realize the situation.</b>

32:51.585 --> 32:53.450
<b>You killed the client.</b>

32:53.853 --> 32:56.152
<b>Mr. Kanie gave me the wrong target.</b>

32:56.823 --> 32:57.848
<b>It's not my fault.</b>

32:57.957 --> 33:00.016
<b>The result is all that counts!</b>

33:00.260 --> 33:01.887
<b>Then do it yourself!</b>

33:07.197 --> 33:08.961
<b>Don't stay out for too long!</b>

33:36.154 --> 33:36.779
<b>Sawa!</b>

33:43.360 --> 33:43.985
<b>What's up?</b>

33:50.031 --> 33:51.726
<b>Are you okay?</b>

33:52.334 --> 33:53.698
<b>Of course not.</b>

33:54.235 --> 33:55.224
<b>It still hurts.</b>

33:56.036 --> 33:58.129
<b>I have a bald spot and everything.</b>

33:58.439 --> 33:59.463
<b>I'm exhausted.</b>

34:00.406 --> 34:00.964
<b>Come in.</b>

34:01.408 --> 34:02.306
<b>I'll make some coffee.</b>

34:02.809 --> 34:03.672
<b>I prefer tea.</b>

34:04.443 --> 34:05.967
<b>Really strong green tea.</b>

34:06.578 --> 34:07.943
<b>I don't have any.</b>

34:09.748 --> 34:10.577
<b>I brought some.</b>

34:18.689 --> 34:20.121
<b>It's bitter...</b>

34:20.790 --> 34:21.847
<b>It's good!</b>

34:28.963 --> 34:29.553
<b>Sawa...</b>

34:30.630 --> 34:31.119
<b>What?</b>

34:32.499 --> 34:35.262
<b>What will we be
doing ten years from now?</b>

34:35.969 --> 34:37.367
<b>What kind of question is that?</b>

34:42.607 --> 34:44.506
<b>There's only one target.</b>

34:45.143 --> 34:47.406
<b>It's an easy job for you.</b>

34:48.645 --> 34:50.134
<b>You got that, Oburi?</b>

34:51.313 --> 34:53.838
<b>Be on time tonight.</b>

34:57.118 --> 34:57.709
<b>Sawa...</b>

35:01.688 --> 35:02.745
<b>Ten years...</b>

35:03.156 --> 35:04.055
<b>Five years...</b>

35:04.925 --> 35:07.655
<b>Even tomorrow
may never come for us.</b>

35:08.693 --> 35:11.423
<b>All I can do for now
is live life to the fullest.</b>

35:13.064 --> 35:15.122
<b>Your life or even tomorrow's lunch...</b>

35:15.599 --> 35:16.998
<b>No one knows what it'll be.</b>

35:18.434 --> 35:19.060
<b>Akai?</b>

35:20.069 --> 35:20.727
<b>That's right.</b>

35:21.436 --> 35:22.802
<b>...to kill you.</b>

35:23.405 --> 35:25.100
<b>That's why you came here?</b>

35:26.408 --> 35:27.533
<b>You knew that, right?</b>

35:28.576 --> 35:29.304
<b>Get ready.</b>

35:30.577 --> 35:32.808
<b>Your parents were killed by...</b>

35:33.380 --> 35:34.472
<b>...Akai and Kanie.</b>

35:39.150 --> 35:39.982
<b>I know.</b>

35:40.252 --> 35:41.309
<b>...for a long time now.</b>

35:50.260 --> 35:52.455
<b>Promise to come back here.</b>

35:58.533 --> 36:01.262
<b>This guy's a
prosecutor for the DA's office.</b>

36:03.536 --> 36:07.734
<b>He was bribed to ignore the
illegal activities of a big corporation.</b>

36:08.975 --> 36:13.137
<b>He'll be in the last train car in three
minutes, so take care of him there.</b>

36:14.413 --> 36:16.607
<b>He doesn't look like a
government suit type.</b>

36:17.014 --> 36:18.345
<b>Be careful.</b>

36:19.683 --> 36:21.776
<b>I don't want Mr. Akai to fire me just yet.</b>

38:10.837 --> 38:12.327
<b>Who the hell are you?</b>

38:12.506 --> 38:13.563
<b>Don't you know?</b>

38:14.206 --> 38:15.833
<b>Just an ordinary citizen.</b>

38:16.075 --> 38:16.631
<b>Die.</b>

38:27.750 --> 38:29.650
<b>You shitty punk!</b>

38:32.220 --> 38:32.878
<b>You punk!</b>

38:33.054 --> 38:34.487
<b>I'm gonna chop you into pieces!</b>

38:36.257 --> 38:37.225
<b>The one in pieces...</b>

38:38.358 --> 38:39.052
<b>...is you!</b>

39:45.077 --> 39:46.978
<b>Sorry, Mr. Akai.</b>

39:47.580 --> 39:51.447
<b>Oburi, what are you doing?</b>

39:51.982 --> 39:53.008
<b>Don't even try it!</b>

39:55.151 --> 39:56.983
<b>Calm down, okay?</b>

39:57.387 --> 39:59.720
<b>Who the hell was that prosecutor?</b>

40:00.289 --> 40:03.951
<b>A cop from the SWAT team.</b>

40:04.993 --> 40:06.552
<b>Didn't Kanie tell you that?</b>

40:06.828 --> 40:08.193
<b>That guy had a gun...</b>

40:09.064 --> 40:10.257
<b>He tried to kill me!</b>

40:12.365 --> 40:15.198
<b>What do I have to do with that?</b>

40:19.605 --> 40:21.573
<b>I'm going to disappear from your sight.</b>

40:23.174 --> 40:25.108
<b>If you follow me, I'll kill you.</b>

40:25.410 --> 40:26.809
<b>Hold it, hold it.</b>

40:27.011 --> 40:29.571
<b>You promised to do
two more jobs, didn't you?</b>

40:30.713 --> 40:31.976
<b>Do it yourself.</b>

40:33.149 --> 40:34.673
<b>Is Sawa with you?</b>

40:35.117 --> 40:36.345
<b>I'm taking her with me.</b>

40:37.285 --> 40:38.150
<b>I see...</b>

40:59.637 --> 41:02.229
<b>You punk, you caused
me some serious trouble...</b>

41:02.938 --> 41:03.735
<b>What happened?</b>

41:04.740 --> 41:05.365
<b>You!</b>

41:05.707 --> 41:07.334
<b>I thought you died already!</b>

41:13.414 --> 41:14.107
<b>Get away!</b>

41:14.981 --> 41:15.971
<b>Get away from him!</b>

41:16.415 --> 41:17.473
<b>Sawa...</b>

41:21.253 --> 41:22.685
<b>Oburi, hang on!</b>

41:23.021 --> 41:23.851
<b>Hang on!</b>

41:26.957 --> 41:28.255
<b>S-Sawa...</b>

41:28.892 --> 41:29.949
<b>Why are you here?</b>

41:30.662 --> 41:31.525
<b>Can you stand?</b>

41:32.563 --> 41:33.290
<b>I guess...</b>

41:35.565 --> 41:38.397
<b>I'm losing feeling in my left arm...</b>

41:38.867 --> 41:40.663
<b>We'd better take care of you quickly.</b>

41:46.840 --> 41:47.534
<b>Don't move!</b>

41:59.518 --> 42:00.540
<b>Sawa...</b>

42:01.017 --> 42:03.713
<b>Oburi, I won't kill you.</b>

42:06.922 --> 42:09.822
<b>Sawa, thank me.</b>

42:10.558 --> 42:12.457
<b>No, let me go!</b>

42:12.760 --> 42:14.818
<b>No! No!</b>

42:15.095 --> 42:16.118
<b>Stop it!</b>

42:16.498 --> 42:17.828
<b>Kanie, you want to shoot him?</b>

42:18.231 --> 42:23.465
<b>Yeah, I really want to shoot this
punk and splatter his blood all over.</b>

42:26.204 --> 42:27.398
<b>You hear that?</b>

42:27.839 --> 42:29.466
<b>What are you going to do, Sawa?</b>

42:43.383 --> 42:47.480
<b>Oburi, a dog is better
off chained to its master.</b>

43:08.271 --> 43:09.102
<b>Don't...</b>

43:16.011 --> 43:16.635
<b>No...</b>

44:36.039 --> 44:39.371
<b>You didn't have to do
all this just to kill him.</b>

44:39.610 --> 44:42.009
<b>Just killing him isn't enough for me.</b>

44:42.078 --> 44:43.875
<b>You hate him that much?</b>

44:44.447 --> 44:45.971
<b>It's not just that.</b>

44:46.249 --> 44:48.272
<b>It's my hobby.</b>

44:48.483 --> 44:49.278
<b>Hobby?</b>

44:50.451 --> 44:54.581
<b>I really take pleasure in
watching other people's pain.</b>

44:55.722 --> 44:59.249
<b>Nothing else makes me feel like that.</b>

44:59.425 --> 45:00.482
<b>Gross hobby.</b>

45:01.727 --> 45:04.456
<b>Your act really scared me.</b>

45:04.528 --> 45:08.019
<b>I almost thought you'd
betray me for a second...</b>

45:09.399 --> 45:11.662
<b>So, I'll be on my own from now on.</b>

45:12.035 --> 45:13.229
<b>Don't worry.</b>

45:13.303 --> 45:15.600
<b>We already found a
replacement for Oburi.</b>

45:16.473 --> 45:17.961
<b>Where are you going to kill him?</b>

45:18.538 --> 45:22.670
<b>The place where we
made you kill for the first time.</b>

45:23.011 --> 45:25.478
<b>I'm looking forward
to tomorrow's autopsy.</b>

45:26.313 --> 45:26.972
<b>I'm going back.</b>

45:29.616 --> 45:31.549
<b>Why don't you stay tonight?</b>

45:31.617 --> 45:32.775
<b>I have an exam tomorrow.</b>

45:33.418 --> 45:35.648
<b>Why don't you drop out of college?</b>

45:37.087 --> 45:40.818
<b>I look better with
pencils than with guns.</b>

45:43.493 --> 45:46.426
<b>Death caused by massive blood loss.</b>

45:47.864 --> 45:49.489
<b>There are several bullets.</b>

45:50.132 --> 45:53.158
<b>I don't appreciate doing this kind
of stuff first thing in the morning.</b>

45:53.800 --> 45:57.565
<b>We've done most of the
checking before you came in.</b>

45:58.004 --> 45:59.062
<b>Good work.</b>

46:05.576 --> 46:06.736
<b>What's wrong?</b>

46:07.111 --> 46:08.408
<b>This isn't like you...</b>

46:09.480 --> 46:10.776
<b>Did you notice?</b>

46:11.182 --> 46:12.240
<b>What?</b>

46:13.016 --> 46:14.380
<b>I just realized, Mr. Akai...</b>

46:15.151 --> 46:15.913
<b>This place.</b>

46:16.918 --> 46:18.682
<b>It's a parking lot now...</b>

46:19.121 --> 46:22.248
<b>...but this is where that family
got slaughtered a few years ago.</b>

46:23.258 --> 46:24.190
<b>A few years ago...</b>

46:24.758 --> 46:26.989
<b>We did the investigation, you know.</b>

46:27.760 --> 46:30.524
<b>I remember they had a daughter.</b>

46:31.229 --> 46:33.528
<b>She was adopted by somebody.</b>

46:34.299 --> 46:36.597
<b>It was a really sexy girl.</b>

46:38.202 --> 46:39.100
<b>Oburi...</b>

46:58.618 --> 47:02.951
<b>Oburi, I didn't think you
had the balls to kill Kanie.</b>

47:03.923 --> 47:07.153
<b>But in your condition, I
don't think you can beat me.</b>

47:08.127 --> 47:08.615
<b>Right?</b>

47:12.730 --> 47:15.096
<b>This time, I'll nail you myself!</b>

47:21.536 --> 47:24.972
<b>Right now, you don't even
have the strength to pull that trigger!</b>

47:26.474 --> 47:27.634
<b>...not with your left hand.</b>

47:30.176 --> 47:31.006
<b>Sawa?</b>

47:36.516 --> 47:37.981
<b>What's going on, Sawa?</b>

47:40.818 --> 47:41.910
<b>My hand!</b>

47:43.054 --> 47:45.111
<b>You and Oburi...</b>

47:45.523 --> 47:47.490
<b>The one who killed Kanie was me.</b>

47:47.990 --> 47:48.957
<b>Oburi is fine.</b>

47:49.958 --> 47:52.359
<b>The two of you tricked me...</b>

47:52.728 --> 47:53.284
<b>Why?</b>

47:53.695 --> 47:56.527
<b>Do you know how long
I've waited for this moment?</b>

47:57.431 --> 47:58.558
<b>This is for Papa and Mama...</b>

48:00.769 --> 48:01.700
<b>...and for me.</b>

48:02.502 --> 48:03.799
<b>Sawa!</b>

49:02.450 --> 49:03.108
<b>Let's go!</b>

49:17.394 --> 49:18.521
<b>Where the hell were you?</b>

49:19.396 --> 49:20.090
<b>Shut up!</b>

49:20.363 --> 49:21.524
<b>I'm gonna win today!</b>

49:21.731 --> 49:23.197
<b>Go get everybody!</b>

49:27.635 --> 49:29.228
<b>Wait just a little longer...</b>

49:32.341 --> 49:33.203
<b>Pretty soon...</b>

49:33.707 --> 49:35.265
<b>Oburi will be back.</b>
